  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 111713996800
    m_Localized: <anim:wave><color=yellow>Welcome to the new chapter!</color></anim>.
      Here everything revolves around your first processor - the single-cycle processor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140197515264
    m_Localized: Unfortunately the dialogues for this chapter aren't quite finished
      yet :(\nBut don't worry, I'm already working hard on it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 150624555008
    m_Localized: 'The good news is: all the levels of this chapter are already playable
      and solvable. Right now you just unfortunately have to get by without hints
      and explanations.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 160497946624
    m_Localized: In the "Multi-cycle processor" chapter, on the other hand, everything
      is already completely finished!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2183191941894144
    m_Localized: Process the value from Instruction Memory at address 0 correctly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2183264188780544
